MQTT bridge for the imud IMU daemon (with Home Assistant discovery)
 imud-mqtt connects to imud's local binary stream socket and publishes scalar
 telemetry topics (heading, attitude, rate of turn, heave, heave rate,
 temperature) to an MQTT broker via libmosquitto, plus Home Assistant
 MQTT-discovery configs so the sensors self-register as one device. Supports
 QoS, retained values, TLS, and an availability topic backed by an MQTT
 last-will.
